---
# The tests keep the root checks except the cognitive complexity limit: ASSERT_* and RUN expand to
# branches, so a test function (and every main) scores far above what its code reads like. Likewise
# ASSERT_TRUE(a && b) expands to !(a && b), which simplify-boolean-expr wants rewritten.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-readability-function-cognitive-complexity,-readability-simplify-boolean-expr'
